test_case_title:
${
      doNotPromptForParty ? 'Does not prompt' : 'Prompts'
    } for party ...

test_case_steps:
1. Use spec 'test/e2e/integration/frontend-test/party-selection.ts' (suite: Party selection). 2. Execute scenario: ${
      doNotPromptForParty ? 'Does not prompt' : 'Prompts'
    } for party when doNotPromptForParty = ${doNotPromptForParty}, on instantiation with multiple possible parties. 3. Stub/observe network requests (cy.intercept). 4. Locate UI elements by visible text (contains). 5. Enter user input into fields (type). 6. Trigger actions via clicks (click). 7. Assert UI/state expectations (should).
